    'After washing, apply an antiseptic such as povidone-iodine or 70% alcohol if you have it, and cover the wound loosely.': '清洗後，如有聚維酮碘或 70% 酒精等消毒劑，請塗抹在傷口上，並松松地覆蓋。',
