    'Auto-injectors are hard to buy in Thailand, Vietnam, Cambodia and Laos and are often unavailable outside major private hospitals.': '在泰國、越南、柬埔寨和寮國，自動注射器很難買到，除大型私立醫院外往往沒有供應。',
    'Bangkok’s BTS and MRT and the inter-city VIP buses and trains are reliable; on overnight trains you can request a lower berth when booking.': '曼谷的 BTS 和 MRT，以及城際 VIP 巴士和火車都很可靠；乘坐夜間火車時，預訂時可要求下鋪。',
    'CPR and choking for every age, allergic reactions, bleeding, heart attack and stroke, a full babies-and-children section, snakes and marine life, and how to actually get help here. Checked against named medical authorities — see its own sources.': '涵蓋各年齡段的心肺復甦和噎食急救、過敏反應、出血、心臟病發作和中風，還有完整的嬰幼兒部分、蛇類和海洋生物，以及在當地如何真正獲得幫助。內容已對照有名可查的醫療權威機構核對，詳見其自帶的來源。',
    'Checked hospitals with a 24-hour emergency department come first (children’s care first for a family), then straight-line distance. Closer places from OpenStreetMap follow, unchecked. The full screen has the rest of the country, what to do where nothing is listed, how people reach a hospital here, and your medical card.': '經覈實、設有 24 小時急診科的醫院排在最前（帶家人同行時優先顯示兒童診療），然後按直線距離排序。其後是來自 OpenStreetMap、尚未覈實的較近地點。完整頁面還有全國其他地區、無任何地點可選時該怎麼辦、當地人如何前往醫院，以及您的醫療卡。',
    'Choose accommodation with strong recent reviews and 24-hour reception; a door that locks from the inside, and a padlock for hostel lockers, are worth it.': '請選擇近期評價良好、設有 24 小時前台的住宿；房門可從內側鎖上，並自備一把用於青旅儲物櫃的掛鎖，都很值得。',
    'Consular help is free and is the right first call for a lost passport, an arrest, a death or a large-scale emergency. Find yours and save the address now — searching for it during the emergency is the part that goes wrong.': '領事協助是免費的，遇到護照遺失、被捕、死亡或大規模緊急事件時，應首先聯絡領事館。請現在就找到您的領事館並儲存地址，緊急時才去搜尋，往往會出問題。',
