    'Personalises this section and your journal exports. Optional — skip any time; add it later from here or Settings.': '用於個性化此部分和您的日誌匯出。可選，隨時可跳過；稍後可在此處或「設定」中補充。',
    'Downloads each language’s pronunciations from an online voice once, so the phrasebook’s speaker then works with no signal. There is one audio quality — the online voice does not offer a choice. Lao has no online voice to download from at all yet (tracked separately); this app’s other phrasebook languages already have a voice built into most phones, so a downloaded pack would not buy them anything.': '從線上語音服務一次性下載每種語言的發音，之後常用語手冊的朗讀無需訊號即可使用。音質只有一種，線上語音不提供選擇。寮國語目前還沒有可供下載的線上語音（另行跟進）；本應用的其他常用語手冊語言，大多數手機已內置語音，因此下載語音包對它們沒有幫助。',
