    'Browse or search the region’s wildlife and plants. Tap a name for field marks and a photo search, ▶ to hear its call — the recordings are bundled, so they play offline — and ☆ to keep it in your identifier. Recordings are Creative Commons, from Xeno-canto and iNaturalist.': '瀏覽或搜尋本地區的野生動物和植物。點選名稱可查看識別特徵和照片搜尋，點選 ▶ 可聽其叫聲（錄音已內置，因此可離線播放），點選 ☆ 可將其儲存到您的識別列表中。錄音為知識共享許可，來自 Xeno-canto 和 iNaturalist。',
    'Have a photo? Identify it online (needs internet):': '有照片？線上識別（需要連網）：', 'Location is off': '定位已關閉',
