    'Turn on location to see what is around you — distances, walking times and the closest places, all offline once you have a fix.': '開啓定位即可查看周圍情況：距離、步行時間和最近的地點，獲取一次定位後均可離線使用。',
    'Tap a city to start building your next few stops:': '點選一個城市，開始規劃您接下來的幾站：',
    'Tap a destination above to see how to get there, what’s there, and add it to your trip.': '點選上方的目的地，查看如何前往、那裡有什麼，並將其新增到您的行程。',
    'Search produce…': '搜尋農產品…', 'Stall & pantry': '攤位與食材',
