    'Your decide-now shortlist — nearest and best-matched first. Tap a category chip to filter; map and list stay in sync. Want to browse a whole region? That is what Explore is for.': '您的「馬上決定」候選清單，最近且最匹配的排在最前。點選類別標籤可篩選；地圖和列表保持同步。想瀏覽整個地區？那是「探索」的用途。',
