    'info': '資訊', 'market': '市集', 'money': '金錢', 'nature': '自然', 'nightlife': '夜生活', 'park': '公園', 'stay': '住宿',
    'streetfood': '街頭小吃', 'viewpoint': '觀景點', 'Set up "For you"': '設定「為您推薦」',
    'Set your price range, party and trip length first and these plans sort themselves to fit you.': '請先設定您的價格範圍、同行人數和行程時長，這些計畫就會自動排序以適合您。',
    'Start date for this plan': '此計畫的開始日期', 'Starting': '起價', 'Day pass': '日票', 'Public': '公共',
    'Public swimming pools, hotel & resort day passes, water parks and managed natural swimming spots. Prices are ranges in local currency and change often — guidance only, confirm locally.': '公共游泳池、飯店和度假村的日票、水上樂園，以及有管理的天然游泳點。價格為當地貨幣的區間，且經常變動，僅供參考，請在當地確認。',
    'Water park': '水上樂園', 'Add a stop': '新增一站', 'Nothing logged yet': '尚未記錄任何內容',
    'Stops, journal entries, places you rate and what you spend all gather here once you have written them down.': '站點、日誌條目、您評分的地點和您的花費，一旦記錄下來都會匯集在這裡。',
    'Write a journal entry': '寫一條日誌',
    'Chain buses, trains, boats and flights across Thailand, Laos, Cambodia and Vietnam — including overland border crossings. Times and fares are guidance and work offline.': '把泰國、寮國、柬埔寨和越南的巴士、火車、船和航班串聯起來，包括陸路過境。時間和票價僅供參考，可離線使用。',
    'Choose…': '選擇…', 'Swap': '互換', 'Check / book ↗': '查詢 / 預訂 ↗',
    'Reference departure times for popular routes — guidance only; always reconfirm with the operator or the booking links below.': '熱門路線的參考發車時間，僅供參考，請務必向運營方或下方的預訂連結再次確認。',
    'Schedules': '時刻表',
    'Add pictures here, or add photos to your journal entries and the places you rate — they all gather in this album.': '在這裡新增圖片，或把照片新增到您的日誌條目和您評分的地點，它們都會匯集在這本相簿中。',
    'Add pictures to album': '新增圖片到相簿',
    'It is a photo album of your trip — the pictures you add here plus every photo in your journal — alongside the places you rate, your itinerary and budget. Add pictures below, or start a journal entry.': '這是您行程的相簿，包含您在此新增的圖片和日誌中的每張照片，同時還有您評分的地點、行程安排和預算。請在下方新增圖片，或開始寫一條日誌。',
    'Photo album': '相簿', 'Scrapbook': '剪貼簿', 'Your scrapbook builds itself': '您的剪貼簿會自行生成',
    'Everything is built here on your device and nothing is uploaded. A journey comes out as a single file that holds its own map and pictures, so whoever you send it to can open it in any browser, offline, with no app and no account.': '一切都在您的裝置上生成，不會上傳任何內容。一段旅程會生成一個包含自己地圖和圖片的單一檔案，因此無論發給誰，對方都可在任何瀏覽器中離線開啟，無需應用，也無需帳戶。',
    'Make a journey to share': '製作要分享的旅程',
    'No map yet. Stamp a journal entry with your location, or add a dated stop to your trip, and your route appears here.': '還沒有地圖。為日誌條目標記位置，或為行程新增帶日期的站點，您的路線就會出現在這裡。',
    'Pick what goes in, then send it however you like — message, email, AirDrop. It opens as a normal web page on any phone or computer.': '選擇要包含的內容，然後以任何方式發送：消息、電子電子郵件、AirDrop。它會作為普通網頁在任何手機或電腦上開啟。',
    'There are no accounts here, so a shared journey cannot be taken back: anyone holding the file sees everything you put in it. Make a second journey with less in it for a wider circle.': '這裡沒有帳戶，因此已分享的旅程無法收回：任何拿到該檔案的人都能看到您放入的全部內容。請為更廣泛的圈子另做一份內容更少的旅程。',
    'Your journey, as one page': '您的旅程，整理成一頁', 'List': '列表', 'Rate the classics': '為經典名店評分',
    'The local stalls and food streets worth queueing for — with your own ratings and takes, kept on-device and shown first. Rate a stall and your score drives its colour on the map too.': '值得排隊的本地攤位和美食街，附有您自己的評分和點評，儲存在裝置上並優先顯示。為攤位評分後，您的評分還會決定它在地圖上的顏色。',
    'Where to graze, city by city': '逐城介紹的覓食地點', 'Beat the heat': '避暑', 'Best in the cool morning': '涼爽的早晨最佳',
    'Connect once for weather-aware picks; meanwhile these are ranked by rating and distance.': '連網一次即可獲得結合天氣的推薦；在此之前，這些按評分和距離排序。',
    'Great in clear weather': '晴天最佳', 'If it rains': '如果下雨', 'Market on today': '今日有市集', 'Now': '現在',
    'Plan for a different time or weather': '為不同的時間或天氣做計畫', 'Tonight': '今晚',
    'What’s nearest to me, by distance →': '按距離查看離我最近的 →', 'island': '海島', 'temple': '寺廟', 'worship': '禮拜',
    'Boats & ferries': '船與渡輪', 'Buses': '巴士', 'Buy tickets — flights, trains, buses & boats': '購買機票、火車票、巴士票和船票',
    'Car': '汽車', 'Cheapest': '最便宜', 'Check live times & book (12Go) ↗': '查看即時時刻並預訂（12Go）↗',
    'Chiang Mai → Pai': '清邁 → 拜縣', 'City transit (works offline)': '城市交通（可離線使用）', 'Departures': '發車', 'Fastest': '最快',
    'Flights': '航班',
    'Live times need internet; the guidance above works offline. Schedules shift with season and demand — always confirm on the day.': '即時時刻需要連網；上方的指引可離線使用。時刻表會隨季節和需求變化，請務必當天確認。',
    'One ticket': '一票到底', 'Plan a whole journey A → B (incl. borders)': '規劃從 A 到 B 的整段旅程（含邊境）',
    'Prices and seats are live on these sites. For trains and the fast Laos railway, book a day or two ahead.': '這些網站上的價格和座位是即時的。火車和寮國高速鐵路請提前一兩天預訂。',
    'Rent a scooter or car': '租借踏板機車或汽車', 'Ride-hailing apps': '叫車 App', 'Scooter': '踏板機車',
