    'Times and prices are guidance and change with season and operator. Confirm before travel.': '時間和價格僅供參考，會隨季節和運營方變化。出行前請確認。',
    'Timetables & live schedules': '時刻表與即時班次', 'Travelling with children or a baby': '帶兒童或嬰兒旅行',
    'What it costs (per day)': '費用（每天）', 'Add stop': '新增站點',
    'Add the places or cities you plan to visit, in order.': '按順序新增您打算遊覽的地點或城市。', 'Arrive': '抵達',
    'Arrive date': '抵達日期', 'Budget log': '預算記錄', 'Itinerary': '行程安排', 'Leave (optional)': '離開（可選）',
    'Leave date': '離開日期', 'Place or city': '地點或城市',
    'Set arrive and leave to cover several days in one stop — e.g. ten days in Chiang Mai, without adding each day.': '設定抵達和離開日期，即可在一站中涵蓋多天，例如在清邁待十天，而無需逐天新增。',
    'Stop name': '站點名稱', 'Choose a passcode (min 4 characters)': '設定密碼（至少 4 個字符）', 'Confirm passcode': '確認密碼',
    'Create vault': '建立保險庫',
    'Documents are encrypted with your passcode and stored only on this device — never uploaded. Save your recovery code and an encrypted backup, and a forgotten passcode need never lock you out.': '證件使用您的密碼加密，僅儲存在此裝置上，絕不上傳。請儲存恢復碼和加密備份，這樣忘記密碼也不會讓您無法進入。',
    'Moving from another device? Restore your encrypted backup, then unlock it with the same passcode.': '從其他裝置遷移？請恢復您的加密備份，然後用相同的密碼解鎖。',
    'Passcode': '密碼', 'Passcode reminder (optional)': '密碼提示（可選）', 'Set up your vault': '設定您的保險庫',
    'You’ll get a one-time recovery code next — save it. The reminder below is just a hint, not your passcode.': '接下來您會獲得一次性恢復碼，請務必儲存。下方的提示只是一個提醒，不是您的密碼。',
    'e.g. my usual PIN + birth year': '例如：我常用的 PIN + 出生年份',
    '10-year, issued as 5+5, run by the Board of Investment': '10 年期，分 5+5 年簽發，由投資促進委員會管理',
    '5-year, multiple-entry; 180 days per stay, extendable once by +180': '5 年期，多次入境；每次停留 180 天，可延期一次 +180 天',
    'At land borders': '在陸路邊境',
    'Chiang Mai is the region’s biggest nomad hub, with many cafés and coworking spaces (for example Punspace and CAMP); Bangkok, Phuket and Koh Lanta also have coworking. Spending 180+ days in a tax year can make you a Thai tax resident — take advice.': '清邁是該地區最大的數位遊牧中心，有許多咖啡廳和共同工作空間（例如 Punspace 和 CAMP）；曼谷、普吉島和蘭達島也有共同工作空間。在一個納稅年度內停留 180 天以上，可能使您成為泰國稅務居民，請咨詢專業意見。',
    'Common visa scams': '常見簽證騙局', 'DTV — Destination Thailand Visa': 'DTV：泰國目的地簽證',
